  "pre_response": "<short 1-sentence active status message indicating what decision was made>",
  "accumulated_context_data": "<string: rolling context. Preserve the last 2 interactions in full detail as-is. For older interactions beyond the last 2, summarize into concise keyword-only points, removing grammatical filler words, keeping only essential entities, host names, commands, and key findings.>",
